    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Fak Ops plane statuses, live from the scheduler",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Scheduler, queue, report-window and stuck-work telemetry folded by the Fak Ops statuses exporter (`fak_ops_*`, scraped from the ops dashboard server). **Unavailable means missing evidence**, not zero: an absent `.fak/ops.json` or report ledger folds to an honest empty plane, and a failed probe renders as partial with a named diagnostic on the exporter's /status page. Run `fak-ops-dashboard` (default `127.0.0.1:9096`) and point the `fak_ops` file-SD target at it."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
